{"id": "62f1af803d52ed0b07c0e11a02c1423258c6671950eba01cfc67b89663ee97f1", "kind": "method", "name": "fromJson", "qualified_name": "Crest::StoreSetDto::fromJson", "namespace": "Crest", "source_file": "/workspaces/crest-knowledge-assistant/data/CrestApi/src/StoreSetDto.cxx", "start_line": 27, "end_line": 35, "signature": "StoreSetDto StoreSetDto::fromJson(const json &j) ", "documentation": null, "source_code": "StoreSetDto StoreSetDto::fromJson(const json &j) {\n  StoreSetDto storeSetDto;\n  json jsonResources = j.value(\"resources\", json::array());\n  for (auto it = jsonResources.begin(); it != jsonResources.end(); ++it) {\n    storeSetDto.push_back(StoreDto::fromJson(*it));\n  }\n\n  return storeSetDto;\n}"}
